    "q-82238": {
      "dom_id": "step-q82238",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Find an expression for the height $h$ of a cylinder in terms of its volume $V$ given that the ratio of the radius of the base to the height of the cylinder is $\\frac{1}{3}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the fact that the ratio of the radius $r$ of the base to the height $h$ is $\\frac{1}{3},$ we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{r}{h} & =\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nOur goal is to express $h$ in terms of $V.$ Therefore, we need to isolate $r$ in the above equation, which we do using cross-multiplication:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{r}{h} & =\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ 3r & =h \\\\ r & =\\frac{h}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe volume of a cylinder with radius $r$ and height $h$ is given by\n\n$$\nV=\\pi {r}^{2}h.\n$$\n\nTherefore, substituting $r=\\frac{h}{3}$ into the formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}V & =\\pi {r}^{2}h \\\\ V & =\\pi {(\\frac{h}{3})}^{2}\\cdot h \\\\ V & =\\pi \\cdot \\frac{{h}^{2}}{9}\\cdot h \\\\ V & =\\frac{\\pi {h}^{3}}{9} \\\\ {h}^{3} & =\\frac{9V}{\\pi } \\\\ h & =\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{9V}{\\pi }}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82238-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "h=\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{V}{9\\pi }}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"37\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c210E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mroot space=\"4\"><mjx-root style=\"vertical-align: 0.524em; width: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"ss\" style=\"padding-left: 0.724em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-root><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.174em;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D449 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-mroot></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mroot><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>V</mi><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mn>3</mn></mroot></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-82238-b",
